────────────────────
+ do arrange-box
    - box Box
    - hint LayoutArrangeHint = LayoutArrangeHint.full

//gui.layout.builtin.arrange-fast ++
if hint == LayoutArrangeHint.children-only && !box.carried-child
    =? if arrange-flow-content-incremental(box)
arrange-flow-content(box)

